{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 0, "result": {"protocolVersion": "2025-06-18", "capabilities": {"tools": {"listChanged": false}, "resources": {}, "prompts": {}}, "serverInfo": {"name": "ucas", "title": "ucas, a computer algebra system for programmers", "version": "1"}, "instructions": "ucas analyses functions (exhaustively on machine types), does exact algebra and calculus, transforms, number theory and finite fields, and finds cheaper implementations, each answer checked or proved.  Expressions are ucas syntax strings; give parameters types (x: u8, x: f32, x: real) where it matters.  Definitions persist across calls.  An ambiguous input is an error listing its readings: retry with args.assume.KEY.  structuredContent holds the typed result, checks and proof."}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "critical points of x^3 - 3x:\n  x^3 - 3x' = 3x^2 - 3\n  x ≈ -1: local maximum, x^3 - 3x = 2\n  x ≈ 1: local minimum, x^3 - 3x = -2\n  searched [-10, 10] (default; give x a range)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 1, "ok": true, "cmd": "crit", "ucas": "crit x^3 - 3x", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "crit", "derivative": "3x^2 - 3", "points": [{"x": -1, "kind": "local maximum", "value": 2}, {"x": 1, "kind": "local minimum", "value": -2}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "proof": {"kind": "numeric", "text": "sign changes of the derivative on a grid, refined by bisection"}, "files": [], "text": "critical points of x^3 - 3x:\n  x^3 - 3x' = 3x^2 - 3\n  x ≈ -1: local maximum, x^3 - 3x = 2\n  x ≈ 1: local minimum, x^3 - 3x = -2\n  searched [-10, 10] (default; give x a range)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "zeros of 3x^2 - 3:\n  2 zeros:\n    x = -1\n    x = 1\n  proved: a polynomial of degree 2 has 2 roots counted with multiplicity\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 2, "ok": true, "cmd": "zeros", "ucas": "zeros 3x^2-3", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "zeros", "var": "x", "identically_zero": false, "count": 2, "zeros": [{"value": {"value": -1, "exact": "-1"}, "multiplicity": 1}, {"value": {"value": 1, "exact": "1"}, "multiplicity": 1}], "complex": 0}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "proof": {"kind": "symbolic", "text": "proved: a polynomial of degree 2 has 2 roots counted with multiplicity"}, "files": [], "text": "zeros of 3x^2 - 3:\n  2 zeros:\n    x = -1\n    x = 1\n  proved: a polynomial of degree 2 has 2 roots counted with multiplicity\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "monotonic x^3 - 3x:\n  not monotonic on all real x\n  maximal intervals of monotonicity:\n    x in (-inf, -1]: increasing\n    x in [-1, 1]: decreasing\n    x in [1, inf): increasing\n  witness: x = -2 < x = -1 but f(-2) = -2 < f(-1) = 2 (not decreasing)\n  witness: x = -1 < x = 1 but f(-1) = 2 > f(1) = -2 (not increasing)\n  proved symbolically: x^3 - 3x' = 3x^2 - 3; its real roots: -1, 1 (exact); f' keeps its sign between roots of odd multiplicity\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 3, "ok": true, "cmd": "monotonic", "ucas": "monotonic x^3 - 3x", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "monotonic", "var": "x", "verdict": "not monotonic", "on": "all real x", "intervals": [{"lo": null, "hi": -1, "direction": "increasing", "strict": true}, {"lo": -1, "hi": 1, "direction": "decreasing", "strict": true}, {"lo": 1, "hi": null, "direction": "increasing", "strict": true}], "witness_not_decreasing": [-2, -1], "witness_not_increasing": [-1, 1]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "proof": {"kind": "symbolic", "text": "proved symbolically: x^3 - 3x' = 3x^2 - 3; its real roots: -1, 1 (exact); f' keeps its sign between roots of odd multiplicity"}, "files": [], "text": "monotonic x^3 - 3x:\n  not monotonic on all real x\n  maximal intervals of monotonicity:\n    x in (-inf, -1]: increasing\n    x in [-1, 1]: decreasing\n    x in [1, inf): increasing\n  witness: x = -2 < x = -1 but f(-2) = -2 < f(-1) = 2 (not decreasing)\n  witness: x = -1 < x = 1 but f(-1) = 2 > f(1) = -2 (not increasing)\n  proved symbolically: x^3 - 3x' = 3x^2 - 3; its real roots: -1, 1 (exact); f' keeps its sign between roots of odd multiplicity\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 4, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "convexity of x^3 - 3x:\n  neither convex nor concave on all real x\n    x in (-inf, 0]: concave (f'' < 0)\n    x in [0, inf): convex (f'' > 0)\n  inflection points: x = 0\n  witness: f(-1) = 2 > (f(-2) + f(0))/2 = -1\n  proved symbolically: f'' = 6x, a polynomial; its sign changes only at real roots of odd multiplicity\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 4, "ok": true, "cmd": "convexity", "ucas": "convexity x^3 - 3x", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "convexity", "inflection_points": "x = 0", "witness": "f(-1) = 2 > (f(-2) + f(0))/2 = -1", "proved_symbolically": "f'' = 6x, a polynomial; its sign changes only at real roots of odd multiplicity", "headline": "convexity of x^3 - 3x:", "details": ["neither convex nor concave on all real x", "x in (-inf, 0]: concave (f'' < 0)", "x in [0, inf): convex (f'' > 0)"]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "convexity of x^3 - 3x:\n  neither convex nor concave on all real x\n    x in (-inf, 0]: concave (f'' < 0)\n    x in [0, inf): convex (f'' > 0)\n  inflection points: x = 0\n  witness: f(-1) = 2 > (f(-2) + f(0))/2 = -1\n  proved symbolically: f'' = 6x, a polynomial; its sign changes only at real roots of odd multiplicity\n"}, "isError": false}}
